{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TrillionniumFoundation/trillionnium-os-desktop/pulls/196","id":4914285113,"node_id":"PR_kwDOVLzC488AAAABJOoKOQ","html_url":"https://github.com/TrillionniumFoundation/trillionnium-os-desktop/pull/196","diff_url":"https://github.com/TrillionniumFoundation/trillionnium-os-desktop/pull/196.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/TrillionniumFoundation/trillionnium-os-desktop/pull/196.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TrillionniumFoundation/trillionnium-os-desktop/issues/196","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TrillionniumFoundation/trillionnium-os-desktop/pulls/196/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TrillionniumFoundation/trillionnium-os-desktop/pulls/196/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TrillionniumFoundation/trillionnium-os-desktop/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TrillionniumFoundation/trillionnium-os-desktop/issues/196/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TrillionniumFoundation/trillionnium-os-desktop/statuses/5060ac6976b56b32647c728991e489cdee1cce9d","number":196,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"fix(ui): bind Runtime freshness to complete sample age","user":{"login":"Franksudoman","id":273670192,"node_id":"U_kgDOEE_gMA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/273670192?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Franksudoman","html_url":"https://github.com/Franksudoman","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Franksudoman/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Franksudoman/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Franksudoman/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Franksudoman/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Franksudoman/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Franksudoman/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Franksudoman/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Franksudoman/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Franksudoman/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## 问题\nRuntime health 仍使用分开的 wall-age / receipt-age 检查。Session 样本 6,000 ms、完整 IPC 20 ms、UI 队列 1,991 ms 时，总龄已是 8,011 ms；墙钟回拨后真实 Desktop/egui 标题却仍可显示 `OBSERVED`。原有 known-run 总年龄规则不能替 Runtime 补上这一缺口。\n\n## 变化\n- Session 在完整 Runtime poll 开始前记单调采样点，只在完整成功后推进非零、不回绕序号；失败和独立 run 读不刷新旧 Runtime。\n- Shell 按样本年龄、完整 IPC RTT、实际 receipt 至绘制时间之和判定；同来源同序号保留推进后的年龄上界，同 Session 临时缺历史不清空旧锚。Runtime 与 known-run 保持独立。\n- 新增两项实际 `hepta-submit` SIGKILL/reap 回归，覆盖 stdin EOF 释放前、完整原帧已发而回复未到的边界；生产 CLI 传输不变。\n- 补齐 A04 主干开发交接与 A06 cpu.max/owner 入口，同步 STATUS、工作区及新鲜度技术文档。\n- 归档可逐字节恢复的 R7 原文与明确缺失清单，补充 R8 ARM 已完成运行的独立读回；历史材料不计为新 R9 执行。\n\n## 实际验证\n- 固定 Rust 1.88：最终完整 UI workspace **137 passed / 0 failed / 2 existing CJK ignored**；strict workspace/all-targets Clippy `-D warnings`、fmt 和四程序 bins 构建通过。\n- 初始实际 RED **1 passed / 1 intended failed**；最终完整 suite 包含 7,000 ms 正例、8,011 ms 反例、真实 egui 状态、独立 run、同来源缺历史、慢 poll/run 和失败不续时的实际 Session/UDS 回归。\n- 真实 CLI：完整 objective feature suite **43 passed**（新增两项包含其中），feature-off all-targets check、strict Clippy、fmt 通过。\n- 保留 fixture 的 E0063 和新增字段触发的 large_enum_variant 失败；后者通过局部 boxed clock 修复，没有放宽 lint 或修改公共 Response。\n- 执行来源为各次真实 HEAD + 冻结 patch，完整日志、文件闭包、实际 ELF 与同树发布关系保留于证据目录。云端结论等待此 PR 的精确发布 HEAD，R8 的成功不会转记。\n\n## 部署与范围\n新 `runtime_sample_clock` 不改变原版 Hepta 协议。Session/Shell/ctl 必须匹配部署：新 Shell 对缺 clock 的旧历史保持 unknown，旧严格 decoder 拒绝新字段。默认 Shell/Session 仍只读；CLI 无输出不能成为 NotSent、NotApplied 或持久未受理证明。没有新增 issuer、签名、请求/效果账本、原 owner 在线查询、HOS2 写操作、kernel、compositor/IME 或移动设备资格。\n\n原版 Hepta 与 Asterinas pins、锁文件和 0 字节根 README 保持不变。\n\n## 源码与证据入口\n发布 head：`5060ac6976b56b32647c728991e489cdee1cce9d`；与本地 `2bc512a445f30a53ac4c579fece1ff91c03c8741` 同树 `ae588699126910065c16b77d83f3ef20b53509f2`。实际 UI 执行身份仍为 `09cf2596` + 冻结 patch，完整闭包 `d720db71872f8c263b73ab3b5ad9702a856898a32b7cfde312cfe805156d0fe0`。\n\n- [R9 完整证据](https://github.com/TrillionniumFoundation/trillionnium-os-desktop/blob/5060ac6976b56b32647c728991e489cdee1cce9d/results/integration/2026-10-18-runtime-process-boundaries/README.md)\n- [最终 UI 各次原始结果及四 ELF 身份](https://github.com/TrillionniumFoundation/trillionnium-os-desktop/blob/5060ac6976b56b32647c728991e489cdee1cce9d/results/integration/2026-10-18-runtime-process-boundaries/ui/README.md)\n- [真实 CLI 终止边界](https://github.com/TrillionniumFoundation/trillionnium-os-desktop/blob/5060ac6976b56b32647c728991e489cdee1cce9d/results/integration/2026-10-18-runtime-process-boundaries/hepta-cli/README.md)\n- [最终独立源码审查](https://github.com/TrillionniumFoundation/trillionnium-os-desktop/blob/5060ac6976b56b32647c728991e489cdee1cce9d/results/integration/2026-10-18-runtime-process-boundaries/reviews/r9-a07-runtime-clock-final-source-review.json)\n- [全部模块开发/技术入口](https://github.com/TrillionniumFoundation/trillionnium-os-desktop/blob/5060ac6976b56b32647c728991e489cdee1cce9d/docs/INDEX.md)\n\n178 文件的 R9 证据包逐项 SHA 已核对，21 份压缩日志/patch 解压后与原字节相同，189 处当前文档本地链接可解析。原日志中的原始空白/CRLF 保留；产品源码与现行文档的 `git diff --check` 通过。","labels":[],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2026-10-19T00:49:16Z","updated_at":"2026-10-19T00:49:16Z","closed_at":null,"merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"019df58181d4e9bde9e8b9d345206b6336bcd3f1","assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"head":{"label":"TrillionniumFoundation:agents/A00-r9-followthrough-20261018","ref":"agents/A00-r9-followthrough-20261018","repo":{"id":1421656803,"node_id":"R_kgDOVLzC4w","name":"trillionnium-os-desktop","full_name":"TrillionniumFoundation/trillionnium-os-desktop","owner":{"login":"TrillionniumFoundation","id":262513357,"node_id":"O_kgDOD6WizQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/262513357?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TrillionniumFoundation","html_url":"https://github.com/Trillio